finished the sentence.

00:06:56.584 --> 00:06:58.604 align:start position:0%
&gt;&gt; [music]

00:06:58.680 --> 00:07:04.240 align:start position:0%
&gt;&gt; So, what would you do with a brain 10
times faster?

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:06.880 align:start position:0%
Tell us which sport you'd dominate in
the comments.

00:07:06.409 --> 00:07:10.480 align:start position:0%
&gt;&gt; [music]
&gt;&gt; And if you'd have jumped for that kid,

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:14.324 align:start position:0%
